      "activity": null,
      "traits": [],
      "entries": [
        "As a bonus action, the baliri brays praise to the demon lord that saved it from its previous life, channeling the demon lord's might. The baliri chooses up to three demons within 30 feet of it. Each target has advantage on the first ability check or attack roll it makes before the start of the baliri's next turn. In addition, the targets are unaffected by the baliri's Blood Bray."
